  "releaseNotes": "11.0.0\n\n* New: a net11.0 build, for .NET 11. The netstandard2.0, net8.0, net9.0 and net10.0 builds stay,\n  so nothing changes for a project on an earlier .NET.\n* The major version is 11 because it follows the .NET generation, like the rest of the Com.H\n  family. No API was added, changed or removed since 10.0.0: code that builds against 10.0.0\n  builds against 11.0.0 as it is.\n* The Com.H.Data.Common dependency moves to 11.x.",
